{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1006","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1006/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1006/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1006/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1006","id":1170809406,"node_id":"I_kwDOCX47u85FySI-","number":1006,"title":"Indices with `mssql_include` regenerated on every autogenerate revision","user":{"login":"jonasmiederer","id":7305005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDUwMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7305005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer","html_url":"https://github.com/jonasmiederer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1141241826,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjQxODI2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1141242873,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjQyODcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/autogenerate%20-%20detection","name":"autogenerate - detection","color":"301030","default":false,"description":null},{"id":1145866372,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQ1ODY2Mzcy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/postgresql","name":"postgresql","color":"487cbf","default":false,"description":""},{"id":1145866786,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQ1ODY2Nzg2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/Microsoft%20SQL%20Server","name":"Microsoft SQL Server","color":"5ca7ed","default":false,"description":"microsoft SQL Server, e.g. mssql"},{"id":2977750055,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTc3NzUwMDU1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/cant%20reproduce","name":"cant reproduce","color":"656ADD","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2022-03-16T10:15:54Z","updated_at":"2023-01-25T20:47:54Z","closed_at":"2022-03-16T15:02:11Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen defining included indices in SQLAlchemy on MSSQL-Server using `mssql_include`, autogeneration drops and recreates the index on every new revision because the signature of the indices is different\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nAlembic autogenerate handles included columns in indices correctly\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nWe have a table `test_table` with an index on column `col1`, which also includes `col2` using `mssql_include`:\r\n\r\n```py\r\nclass TestTable(AutoincrementedBase):\r\n    __tablename__ = 'test_table'\r\n    __table_args__ = (Index(None, 'col1', mssql_include=['col2']),) \r\n    # ....\r\n```\r\n\r\nAutogenerating the first revision yields the correct migration: \r\n\r\n```py\r\nop.create_index(op.f('ix__test_table__test_table_col1'), 'test_table', ['col1'], unique=False, mssql_include=['col2'])\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter upgrading and re-running the autogenerate revision, the existing index is dropped and recreated in exactly the same form:\r\n\r\n```py\r\nop.drop_index('ix__test_table__test_table_col1', table_name='test_table')\r\nop.create_index(op.f('ix__test_table__test_table_col1'), 'test_table', ['col1'], unique=False, mssql_include=['col2'])\r\n```\r\n\r\nBy digging into the autogenerate script I found that the signatures of the `conn_obj` and  the `metadata_obj` are different, which causes the index to be regenerated:\r\n\r\n`conn_obj.sig` = `('col2', 'col1')`\r\n`metadata_obj.sig` = `('col1',)`\r\n\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: macOS Monterey (12.2.1)\r\n - Python: 3.7\r\n - Alembic: 1.7.7\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 1.3.24\r\n - Database: Azure SQL Server / MSSQL Server\r\n - DBAPI: mssql / pyodbc / ODBC Driver 17 for SQL Server\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jonasmiederer","id":7305005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDUwMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7305005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer","html_url":"https://github.com/jonasmiederer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonasmiederer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1006/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1006/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}